    "name": "BatchMath v12.9.E \u2014 Final Integration Test",
    "body": "BatchMath v12.9.E teacher test build. Prerelease, not latest. Production main and both approved sources are unchanged; no deployment is performed.\n\nThis combines the completed MathLive/video/keypad foundation (98c9beb) with the final Unit 6 mathematics, one blank integral-setup field, structural grading and videos (049e8a4).\n\nTested website commit: 2fbfd3f7eb482fd6ef5f890ba86fe2a9554db8b6.\n\n[Final integration report and inherited-test classifications](https://github.com/batchmath/BatchMathSite/blob/eae5bdbf4cba60bc7a6c87bc433f447b9fff2d7e/docs/v12.9.E-final-integration.md)\n\nExtract batchmath-site-v12.9.E.zip. Open a terminal inside batchmath-site-v12.9.E, run `py -m http.server 8000`, and open http://localhost:8000/.\n\nThe ZIP contains the complete website, practice engines, PDFs, and pinned local MathLive runtime/fonts. Normal MathJax and YouTube use requires internet. Actual YouTube availability and audio need human review.\n",
